# A tour of the whole grid on one held note (lead track, C3): P1 sweeps every bank's six waves while P2 walks the
# seven banks, slowly first and then fast (full range in a quarter of a step), as a hand or an LFO would.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 0 0 0 0 255 20 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 4
sweep p1 255 0 4 8
sweep p1 0 255 8 12
sweep p1 255 0 12 16
sweep p2 0 255 0 16
sweep p1 0 255 16 17
sweep p1 255 0 17 18
sweep p2 255 0 16 18
param p1 255 20
param p2 0 20
param p1 0 22
param p2 255 22
sweep p1 0 255 24 32
note 0 C3 32 127
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -4
